<task id="102" project="spaarkeai-word-add-in-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>UAT round 6 (4) — Find shows "Similar Documents" and "Matching records" as two sections, each its own scrollable list, with a draggable divider between them; check the "Matter: Matter" / "Unknown" row labels</title>
    <phase>6 UAT round 6 (2026-10-06)</phase>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Modifies production `.tsx` (`FindView.tsx`, `FindResultsList.tsx`) and their tests.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Client-only layout change with a small new interaction (resizable split), decided by the owner.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>UAT6-W1</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Runs beside 101 and 103. Disjoint: 102 owns `FindView.tsx`, `FindResultsList.tsx`, the Find hooks and their tests; it MUST NOT edit `CreateRecordForm.tsx`, `RelatedToPicker.tsx`, `TaskPaneShell.tsx`, `TaskPaneToolbar.tsx`, `taskPaneWidthService.ts`, `App.tsx`, `webpack.config.js` or `ci-gated-suites.txt` (report new suites to the main session). Client-only; if the label defect is server-side, REPORT it, do not edit the BFF.</parallel-reason>
